<newsitem itemid="802123" id="root" date="1997-08-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>HUNGARY: Agrimpex H1 '97 IAS pre-tax loss 385.1mln.</title>
<headline>Agrimpex H1 '97 IAS pre-tax loss 385.1mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result	   72.7 loss vs  405.3 profit</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	    385.1 loss vs  375.1 profit</p>
<p>    Group after-tax result   329.2 loss  vs    301.9 profit</p>
<p>    Group sales		9,736.6	 vs  7,948.4</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	    8,612.8	 vs  6,308.5</p>
<p>    Margin		     1,123.8	 vs  1,640.0</p>
<p>    Direct expenses	    720.9	 vs    778.5</p>
<p>Profit centre</p>
<p>     contribution		402.9	 vs    861.5</p>
<p>Net central admin.</p>
<p>     cost			  501.6	 vs    468.1</p>
<p>    Rental income		 12.9	 vs     10.8</p>
<p>    Other income		  13.2	 vs	1.2</p>
<p>    Net financial income     312.4 loss  vs     30.2 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			55.9 (*)   vs     73.2</p>
<p>    Minorities		     9.1	 vs	5.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Agrimpex Kereskedelmi Rt is a grain trading company. The figures were calculated in accordance with Internatinal Accounting Standards, they are unaudited and consolidated.</p>
<p>(*) (Corporate tax was calculated according to IAS on deferred taxation).</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
